<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Musician, Pt. 2 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864857548"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="1:17.287"><div begin="47.019" end="1:17.287"><p begin="47.019" end="53.629" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.019" end="48.929">Al</span><span begin="48.929" end="50.156">right,</span> <span begin="50.840" end="52.881">star</span><span begin="52.881" end="53.629">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好了 亲爱的</span></p><p begin="54.866" end="1:01.356" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.866" end="55.135">The</span> <span begin="55.135" end="55.588">thought</span> <span begin="55.588" end="56.110">I</span> <span begin="56.110" end="56.288">want</span> <span begin="56.288" end="56.605">you</span> <span begin="56.605" end="56.803">to</span> <span begin="56.803" end="57.558">know</span> <span begin="58.264" end="58.741">was</span> <span begin="58.741" end="1:00.700">ho</span><span begin="1:00.700" end="1:01.356">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望你能知晓的 那份念想是神圣的</span></p><p begin="1:02.096" end="1:09.330" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.096" end="1:02.324">And</span> <span begin="1:02.324" end="1:02.580">you</span> <span begin="1:02.580" end="1:04.673">found</span> <span begin="1:04.673" end="1:05.878">now,</span> <span begin="1:06.671" end="1:08.574">sudden</span><span begin="1:08.620" end="1:09.330">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而就在转瞬之间 你突然将其寻得</span></p><p begin="1:10.089" end="1:17.287" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.089" end="1:10.321">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:10.321" end="1:10.569">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:10.569" end="1:11.082">some</span><span begin="1:11.082" end="1:11.308">thing</span> <span begin="1:11.308" end="1:11.629">I</span> <span begin="1:11.629" end="1:12.014">want</span> <span begin="1:12.014" end="1:12.258">you</span> <span begin="1:12.258" end="1:12.533">to</span> <span begin="1:12.533" end="1:13.244">find,</span> <span begin="1:14.008" end="1:14.246">but</span> <span begin="1:14.246" end="1:14.483">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:14.483" end="1:16.440">ho</span><span begin="1:16.440" end="1:17.287">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为有些事情 我想让你发现 但那如此神圣</span></p></div></body></tt>